[KR2 · Rashi: the timing limit]: C · Ordinary unmarked loss is prohibited here when the owner may not have learned of the loss before the finder took it. #explanation #river #rashi {"id": "KR2", "sourceRef": ["Rashi on Bava Metzia 22b, s.v. אף איסורא"], "sourceUrl": ["https://he.wikisource.org/wiki/בבא_מציעא_כב_ב#רש\"י"], "speaker": "Rashi", "provenanceClass": "C", "hebrewAnchor": "דמצויה אצל כל אדם לא חילק בין אין סימן דכי ידע מיאש ליש סימן דלכי ידע לא מיאש וכי היכי דיש סימן אסיר", "temporalScope": "awareness, despair and possession relative to pickup; scope stated in attributed claim", "baseNodeIds": ["R4", "R6"], "sourceIds": ["ra-timing"], "anchorScope": "Hebrew source context; English claim is a paraphrase or explicitly editorial reconstruction", "reconstructionStatus": "statement", "color": "#53659c"}

